---
import { analyticsOn } from '../data/analytics';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../data/url';
---
<Base title="About this guide" description="Why the AI Learning Guide exists, how it is made, and our privacy promise.">
  <div class="wrap narrow page prose">
    <h1>About this guide</h1>
    <p class="lede">The AI Learning Guide began after watching capable, careful people sign up for expensive "AI app publishing" programs. Those programs taught a little and sold a lot: business formation, tax services, estate plans and coaching, each one presented as the next necessary step.</p>
    <p>Learning to use AI shouldn't cost thousands of dollars or come with pressure. So this guide teaches the same skills for free, in plain language, with no sales pitch.</p>

    <h2>What this guide is</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Free lessons on using AI assistants, AI "agents," and building simple iPhone apps and websites with AI's help.</li>
      <li>Written for curious adults, many of them retired or nearly so, who are new to these tools.</li>
      <li>Honest about money. Some people earn a modest side income from apps or websites. Most earn little. We show realistic numbers.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What this guide is not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>It isn't a business opportunity, and it never asks you for money.</li>
      <li>It isn't financial, legal or tax advice. For those, talk to a licensed professional you choose yourself.</li>
      <li>It isn't connected to any AI company. Products are mentioned because they are popular and useful, not because anyone paid for it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our privacy promise</h2>
    <div class="card">
      {analyticsOn ? (
        <>
          <p>This site has no accounts, no cookies, no ads and no tracking pixels. Nothing you type or read here is linked to you.</p>
          <p>To know roughly how many people visit, the site uses <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>. It counts page visits without cookies, without fingerprinting, and without recording who you are. We see totals, such as "120 visits this week," and nothing about any one person.</p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <p>This site has no accounts, no cookies, no analytics, no ads and no tracking pixels. It loads no outside fonts or scripts. Nothing you do here is recorded or sent anywhere.</p>
      )}
      <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which keeps standard server logs, as every web host does.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>How it's made</h2>
    <p>The lessons were written with the help of an AI assistant, which felt fitting. AI tools change quickly, so screens and prices may look a little different from what's described here. If something is out of date, the AI assistant you're using can usually tell you what changed.</p>

    <p><a href={url('start-here')}>Read "Start here" →</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
